# DeltaTor - speed-optimized portable Tor client config (tor 0.4.9.11)
# Copied by DeltaTor.exe to data\torrc.template, then data\torrc is generated
# from it per the chosen mode. All paths are relative, so the whole folder is
# fully portable: copy/move it anywhere and it still works.

# --- Local proxies (Windows system proxy uses HTTP 8118) ---
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9052 NoIsolateSOCKSAuth
HTTPTunnelPort 127.0.0.1:8118
DNSPort 127.0.0.1:53530
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy reject *

# --- GeoIP (next to tor.exe; needed for country-based options) ---
GeoIPFile geoip
GeoIPv6File geoip6

# --- Remove cover-traffic padding (privacy OFF; pure throughput) ---
# Both padding layers add cells for anti-traffic-analysis on every connection
# and circuit. They are disabled entirely for maximum download/upload speed.
CircuitPadding 0
ConnectionPadding 0
UseMicrodescriptors 1

# --- Bootstrap/circuit tuning (verified to reach 100% from a clean state) ---
# NOTE: ExitNodes/StrictNodes and ConfluxEnabled historically stalled bootstrap
# at 45-50% in this build. ExitNodes stays OFF. Conflux is enabled below and
# is the confirmed-working experiment (bootstrap reached 100% with it).
DormantOnFirstStartup 0
DormantCanceledByStartup 1
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 0
CircuitBuildTimeout 30
MaxCircuitDirtiness 3600
NumEntryGuards 15
NumDirectoryGuards 6
MaxClientCircuitsPending 64
SocksTimeout 60
KeepalivePeriod 3600

# --- Faster start from a clean state (lower directory download delays) ---
ClientBootstrapConsensusAuthorityDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusFallbackDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusAuthorityOnlyDownloadInitialDelay 0
ClientBootstrapConsensusMaxInProgressTries 6

# --- Fetch directory info early so the first circuits are ready sooner ---
FetchDirInfoEarly 1
FetchDirInfoExtraEarly 1

# --- Consider the client connected once 25% of paths succeed (floor; was 0.3) ---
# 0.25 is Tor's hard minimum for this option, so it is the fastest legal value.
PathsNeededToBuildCircuits 0.25

# --- Pluggable transports (same folder as tor.exe; used only when bridges are configured) ---
ClientTransportPlugin webtunnel exec webtunnel.exe
ClientTransportPlugin obfs4 exec obfs4proxy.exe
ClientTransportPlugin snowflake exec snowflake-client.exe

# --- Operational (data\ folder is created next to tor.exe automatically) ---
DataDirectory data
Log notice file data\tor.log
DisableDebuggerAttachment 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
SafeLogging 1

# --- EXPERIMENT: Conflux (split traffic across 2 circuits, throughput UX) ---
# Previously stalled bootstrap at 45-50% in this build. Verified to reach 100%
# in the 0.4.9.11 build; kept ON for the throughput advantage.
ConfluxEnabled 1
ConfluxClientUX throughput

# --- Bridges (added by DeltaTor.exe when needed) ---
# DeltaTor.exe copies this file to torrc.template and writes data\torrc from
# it. When you pick webtunnel/obfs4/vanilla it appends UseBridges 1 + Bridge
# lines from data\bridges\*.txt. Direct mode leaves the file as-is.
